Description
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The Rainbow Reticle Addon with help you identify targets in game by coloring your 
reticles (cross-hairs) certain colors depending on what you are looking at, 
including hostile targets.

This addon will also color the reticle and display the names, as well as 
optionally the level, of guild mates, group mates, and friends.

Original addon by Mitazaki - Exterminatus Rainbow Reticle
http://www.esoui.com/downloads/info118-ExterminatusRainbowReticle.html

Further continued as Rainbow Reticle Updated, by mctaylor and Garkin:
http://www.esoui.com/downloads/info582-RainbowReticleupdated.html
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Manual Installation
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. Go to the "Elder Scrolls Online" folder in your Documents.

NA Version
For Windows: C:\Users\<username>\Documents\Elder Scrolls Online\live\
For Mac: ~/Documents/Elder Scrolls Online/live/

EU Version
For Windows: C:\Users\<username>\Documents\Elder Scrolls Online\liveeu\
For Mac: ~/Documents/Elder Scrolls Online/liveeu/

2. You should find an AddOns folder. If you don't, create one.
3. Extract the addon from the downloaded zip file to the AddOns folder.
4. Log into the game, and in the character creation screen, you'll find
   the addons menu. Enable your addons from there.

